{"unit_id":"XWIDE__dsh-draft-keeper#card-zh","repo":"XWIDE/dsh-draft-keeper","commit":"21a733b6ec3150a5f1e883cca43d903a87f50cd4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-draft-keeper 是适用于 DSH Web 的图片草稿保留插件，在会话输入框挂载时监听附件状态。它把每个会话中的图片草稿镜像到浏览器 IndexedDB，并在切换会话后、输入框空闲时通过 DSH 草稿接口恢复图片。插件只处理图片，保留文件名、类型和修改时间；附件发送或移除后会清除副本，并限制每会话最多 12 张、32 MB。适合经常切换对话且不想重新粘贴截图的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:148-187","client.js:194-241","client.js:398-404"]}
{"unit_id":"XWIDE__dsh-draft-keeper#card-en","repo":"XWIDE/dsh-draft-keeper","commit":"21a733b6ec3150a5f1e883cca43d903a87f50cd4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-draft-keeper preserves image drafts in the DSH Web composer across chat switches. It saves images by session in browser storage and restores them through DSH draft APIs when the composer is empty and idle. Copies are deleted after send or removal, with a limit of 12 images or 32 MB per session.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:148-187","client.js:194-241","client.js:398-404"]}
