{"unit_id":"XWIDE__dsh-draft-keeper#feature-1","repo":"XWIDE/dsh-draft-keeper","commit":"21a733b6ec3150a5f1e883cca43d903a87f50cd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-draft-keeper 的功能「镜像图片草稿」：输入框出现图片附件时，按会话读取草稿并将图片字节与文件元数据保存到浏览器存储。每会话最多保留 12 张、32 MB。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:148-187"]}
{"unit_id":"XWIDE__dsh-draft-keeper#feature-2","repo":"XWIDE/dsh-draft-keeper","commit":"21a733b6ec3150a5f1e883cca43d903a87f50cd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-draft-keeper 的功能「恢复图片附件」：返回会话后，输入框为空且处于 plain 阶段时，将保存的图片重建为 File，并通过 DSH 草稿接口重新添加。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:194-235","client.js:344-393"]}
{"unit_id":"XWIDE__dsh-draft-keeper#feature-3","repo":"XWIDE/dsh-draft-keeper","commit":"21a733b6ec3150a5f1e883cca43d903a87f50cd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-draft-keeper 的功能「完成后遗忘」：当观察到输入框附件从非空变为空时，删除该会话保存的镜像，避免已发送或手动移除的图片之后再次出现。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:238-241","client.js:365-375"]}
{"unit_id":"XWIDE__dsh-draft-keeper#caveat-1","repo":"XWIDE/dsh-draft-keeper","commit":"21a733b6ec3150a5f1e883cca43d903a87f50cd4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-draft-keeper 使用前须知：仅保存图片，每会话限 12 张、32 MB；输入框为空且处于 plain 阶段才恢复。（client.js:15-17、160-166、205-207）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:15-17","client.js:160-166","client.js:205-207"]}
